The native accelerator (native/)

  Built with PyO3 against the bundled interpreter; the Rust source is in
  native/rebsgo_native and the compiled module in native/lib. Its dependency
  tree (pyo3, libc, once_cell, memoffset, target-lexicon, unindent and the
  proc-macro crates around them - 21 packages, pinned in Cargo.lock) is
  MIT or Apache-2.0 licensed, at the user's option.

