The launcher (launcher/rebsgo-launcher.exe)

  A Windows program built from Go with:

    github.com/lxn/walk                 BSD-3-Clause
    github.com/lxn/win                  BSD-3-Clause
    golang.org/x/image, x/sys, x/text   BSD-3-Clause
    gopkg.in/Knetic/govaluate.v3        MIT
    the Go standard library             BSD-3-Clause

  The binary is the same author's separate work and is shipped here for the
  players' convenience; its source is not part of this repository, and it is
  not covered by the repository's AGPL licence.

  Its window is drawn after the game's own launcher, and carries artwork and
  typefaces that belong to the game's rights holders, not to this project.

